From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 01:01:33 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] llama: size the MoE cache from free memory and keep a miss on
 the host when the copy is slower

The cache stayed off unless a size was set, and every miss was uploaded. Leave 384 MiB on the device and run a cold expert on the host when that finishes first.
